        {"glove": 0}
      ],
      "note": [
        "Kill the first two Ropa using 8 bushes. If a Bee or guard spawns, reset the room.",
        "Lure the third Ropa up to the top right and either kill it with bushes or run past it.",
        "Note that it will respawn in it's original location once Link goes far enough, so it may be worth killing it.",
        "Alternatively, shuffle the third and fourth Ropa and kill the fourth one instead to make the last part a bit easier.",
        "At the end, lure the Ropa right of the bush up north and sneak past it.",
        "There is a way to despawn it because it goes too far north while still preventing it from respawning - that can make things easier.",
        "Repeat for the last one to escape."
      ],
      "detailNote": [
        "If Link is able to enter the room with a strong overhead object, like a brown bush or a signpost, this could be a fair bit easier."
      ]
